.header

.h1 Database

.img FULL mcd.dia

Most fields are only filled-in if they are known.


.h2 Tables

.h3 interfaces

Describe interfaces in servers to the network. These are IPv4 interfaces.
An interface is always connected to a server via the column host. 

	id	integer primary key	Unique ID
	access	text	Describe how the server can be accessed
	connect_if	integer	Unused
	host	integer	ID of the server that tis interface belongs to
	hostname	text	Hostname correspinding to the IP
	ifname	text	Name of the interface in the server
	ip	text UNIQUE	IP address
	ip_scope	text	Scope of the network that the interface connects to
	macid	text	MAC id
	options	text	Additional information
	port	integer	If the interface has multiple ports, a port number can be added
	remarks	text	Remarks and comments
	source	text	The scan script that updated this record the last.
	subnet	integer	Unused
	switch	integer	Unused

.h3 subnet

A subnet is determined by the network address. This is the base address for the subnet.
The subnets ar IPv4 subnet. The scope determines what the scan scripts do with the subnet.

	id	integer primary key	Unique ID
	access	text	Unused
	cidr	integer	Bits in the network mask
	name	text	Name of the network
	nwaddress	text UNIQUE	Base IPv4 address
	options	text	Additional information
	remarks	text	Remarks and comments
	scope	text	Scope: empty, global, local, server or shared
	source	text	The scan script that updated this record the last.
	xcoord	integer	Unused
	ycoord	integer	Unused

.h3 server

A server is a device in the network. That can be anything, an appliance, a laptop, a server, or 
something completely different. The name of the server should be unique. Scanscripts may add much of
the additional descriptive fields if Djedefre
can access the server.

	id	integer primary key	Unique ID
	devicetype	text	General type of the device
	interfaces	text	Unused
	last_up	integer	timestamp for last up
	memory	text	memmory in bytes
	name	text UNIQUE	Name of the server
	options	text	Additional information
	os	text	Operating system
	ostype	text	General type of the OS
	processor	text	Processor
	remarks	text	Remarks and comments
	source	text	The scan script that updated this record the last.
	status	text	Status: up, down or excluded
	type	text	Type of the server; determines the icon
	xcoord	integer	Unused
	ycoord	integer	Unused

.h3 pages

Pages determine the contents of the drawing. On a page, an item from a table is displayed
at the given coordinates.
The table is either cloud, server or subnets. The item is the the id in the tables.
Connections between the objects are determined by either the IPv4 relation, the 
.fixed vbox= 
in the options field of the server, or the connections in the l2connect table.


	id	integer primary key	Unique ID
	item	integer	ID from the object in the table
	page	text	Name of the page
	tbl	text	Table where the item is found
	xcoord	integer	Location on the drawing
	ycoord	integer	Location on the drawing

.h3 switch

Currently unused.

	id	integer primary key	Unique ID
	name	text
	ports	integer
	remarks	text	Remarks and comments
	switch	text
	server	integer

.h3 l2connect

L2connect contains the low-level connections between objects. It is not really a layer-2 
connection.

	id	integer primary key	Unique ID
	vlan	text	Name or number of the VLAN
	from_tbl	text
	from_id	integer
	from_port	integer
	to_tbl	text
	to_id	integer
	to_port	integer
	source	text	The scan script that updated this record the last.

.h3 config

	id	integer primary key	Unique ID
	attribute	text
	item	text
	value	text
	comment string

.h3 cloud

	id	integer primary key	Unique ID
	name	text UNIQUE
	options	text
	remarks	text	Remarks and comments
	type	text
	vendor	text
	xcoord	integer Unused
	ycoord	integer Unused
	service	text

.h3 dashboard

	id	integer primary key	Unique ID
	server	text
	type	text
	variable	text
	value	text
	color1	text
	color2	text

.h3 nfs

	id	integer primary key	Unique ID
	client	text
	mountpoint	text
	remarks	text	Remarks and comments
	server	text
	export	text

.h3 users

	id	INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT	Unique ID
	username	TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL
	password_hash	TEXT NOT NULL
	role
